This is a Siren Detector TinyML version. 
It is intended to run on ESP32-P4-WiFi6-Devkit from Waveshare.

To run it, please do the following:
1. Edit `main/siren_config.h` file, add your credentials there
2. Activate your esp-idf environment
3. idf.py build
4. idf.py flash
5. (Optional) idf.py monitor 
